at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-07-20T23:55:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T13:54:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7 stable Mono and 4.5.1 stable Mono\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10, Nvidia 5070Ti, Version: 596.49\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using the CanvasItemMaterial shader with the \"Subtract\" blend mode, sprites should not render over empty space. However, if HDR 2D is enabled, the sprite is rendered over empty space.\nWithout HDR 2D enabled, the expected behaviour: \n<img width=\"1916\" height=\"1033\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3487dc53-3861-4c23-951a-41c88730b46c\" />\nWith HDR 2D enabled:\n<img width=\"1913\" height=\"1034\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/089daf49-2ed4-490a-9be7-deed8ac39986\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new 2D scene\n- Create a CanvasGroup\n- Create two sprites as children of said CanvasGroup, assigning a texture to both\n- Apply a CanvasItemMaterial to the lowest sprite in the tree\n- Set Blend Mode to Subtract\n- Enable HDR 2D in Project Settings (Project > Project Settings > Viewport > HDR 2D) \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[2DHDRTest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30207366/2DHDRTest.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121587/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121587/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}